note The handler: a pinch, or the wheel with the ZoomGraph ctrl gesture held, gives the new zoom (Zoom::by_pinch, Zoom::wheeled), and the pan is recomputed so the cell-space point under the mouse lands at the same pixel with the new cell size. A pinch zooms whatever modifiers are held.
